--------------------------------------------------
PARAMETERS FOR INTERIOR MINIMIZATION (OVER 11θ/7φ)
--------------------------------------------------
nmins: 240
itmax: 1.e+3
ftol: 1.e-6
da: 0.1 ! u(pi)

-------------------------------------------------
PARAMETERS FOR EXTERIOR MAXIMIZATION (OVER x,y,z)
-------------------------------------------------
e-ps: 50 ! population size
e-mg: 100 ! max generations

mutate_gaussian parameters
e-std: 1.
e-expected_num_mutations: 1
e-hard_bounds: [(-np.inf,np.inf), (-np.inf,np.inf), (0.,np.inf)]

uniform_crossover parameters
e-p_swap: 0.4

guess ranges for (x,y,z)
e-gx: [-5.,5.]
e-gy: [-5.,5.]
e-gz: [0.,1.]
